==Battleground==
*3 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dober P.D]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**3 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bringing a wave blocker like [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] or using [[Immune to Waves|wave-immune]] attackers such as talented [[Kung Fu Cat (Special Cat)|Dancer Cat]] or [[Miyamoku Musashi (Special Cat)|Miyamoku Musashi]] can counter the [[Dober P.D]].

[[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] is an effective attacker to stall the [[Owlbrow|Owlbrows]], as well as outranging the [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]].

